\u7903\'3fng v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t b\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc thi\u7871\'3fu cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc kinh t\u7871
