\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 1/ X\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 nh s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu.

\par X\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f (d\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi chung l\'e0 x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp) ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft cho n\'e3m 1987, hi\u7879\'3fn nay Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0ang l\'e0m c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f cho vay \'f0\u7875\'3f x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu.
\par 2/ Ngu\u7891\'3fn b\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889\'3fn l\'fd}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 u \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 Chuy\u7875\'3fn s\u7889\'3f vay n\u7907\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng v\u7873\'3f v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng sang s\u7889\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t b\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889
\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp:
\par C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng n\'f3i tr\'ean, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp thi\u7871\'3fu v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 (ph\u7847\'3fn ng\'e2n s
\'e1ch c\u7845\'3fp + n\u7907\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc) m\'e0 \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng cho vay g\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'ec nay }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn s\u7889\'3f d\'fd n\u7907\'3f \'f0\'f3 th\'e0nh s\u7889\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t b\u7893\'3f sung cho \'f0\u7911\'3f v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\u7921\'3f c
\'f3 theo \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft.
\par Nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp m\'e0 Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ch\'fda cho vay b\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu, nh\'fdng c\'f3 cho vay thu\u7897\'3fc c\'e1c  l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 o\u7841\'3fi  kh\'e1c, th\'ec nay c\u361\'75ng gi\u7843\'3fm s\u7889\'3f d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd n\u7907\'3f vay \'f0\'f3 \'f0\u7875\'3f chuy
\u7875\'3fn th\'e0nh s\u7889\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t b\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi l\u7853\'3fp \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c b\'e1o c\'e1o  c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft (\'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy
