\'3fp \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng), Chi c\u7909\'3fc thu qu\u7889\'3fc doanh v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd t\'e0i ch\'ednh x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp Trung }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd\'f5ng (\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp Trung \'fd\'f5ng) v\'e0 Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909
\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t b\u7857\'3fng c\'e1ch x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn thi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7875\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm t\'fd\'f5ng \u7913\'3fng s\u7889\'3f n\u7907\'3f \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
