\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 - C\'f3 t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn vay v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng : 3 tri\u7879\'3fu
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 trong \'f0\'f3: Ti\u7875\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn 04: 1 tri\u7879\'3fu
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429       vay tr\'ean m\u7913\'3fc : 2 tri\u7879\'3fu
\par K\u7871\'3f to\'e1n x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ghi:
\par - N\u7907\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn 93:\tab \tab 3 tri\u7879\'3fu
\par - C\'f3 t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn 85.2:\tab \tab 3 tri\u7879\'3fu
\par 4/ T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn
\par S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh, Chi c\u7909\'3fc thu qu\u7889\'3fc doanh v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd t\'e0i ch\'ednh x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp Trung }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd\'f5ng, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh
\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t ra t\'fd\'f5ng \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi s\u7889\'3f gi\u7843
\'3fm d\'fd n\u7907\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng, ph\u7843\'3fi th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn s\u7889\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t \'f0\'f3 cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f, k\u7875\'3f c\u7843
\'3f Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc ghi s\u7893\'3f v\'e0 theo d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f5i t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp b\'e1o c
\'e1o c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean.
\par Trong th\'e1ng 11/1987 S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh, Chi c\u7909\'3fc thu qu\u7889\'3fc doanh v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd t\'e0i ch\'ednh x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp Trung }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd\'f5
ng, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp b\'e1o c\'e1o c\'f3 ph\'e2n ra kh\u7889\'3fi Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng g\u7917\'3fi v
\u7873\'3f B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh  (V\u7909\'3f Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc) v\'e0  Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Trung \'fd\'f5ng (V\u7909\'3f Kinh t\u7871\'3f v\'e0 K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch) \'f0\u7875\'3f Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907
\'3fp \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd v\'e0 h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd l\'ean c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd c
\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean. C\u361\'75ng trong th\'e1ng 11/1987, B\u7897\'3f v\'e0 S\u7903\'3f ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f x\u7917\'3f l\'fd \u7903\'3f ng\'e0nh m\'ecnh}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429  cho c\'f5 quan T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng c\'f9ng c\u7845\'3fp.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd v\'e0 \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng cho t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f3 quan h\u7879\'3f v\u7889\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng Ng\'e2
n h\'e0ng thu\u7897\'3fc t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c ng\'e0nh kinh t\u7871\'3f Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par - B\'fd\u7899\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp theo kho\u7843\'3fng th\'e1ng 11 - 12/1987, c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o m\u7863\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng gi\'e1 m\u7899\'3fi, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi t\'ednh to\'e1n l\u7841\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn l
\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 v\'e0 coi nh\'fd t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch theo c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi th\'f4ng t\'fd Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng s\u7889\'3f 46-TT/LB/TC-NH ng\'e0
y 30/9/1987 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fnvi\u7879\'3fc x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 v\u7853\'3ft t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea t\u7891\'3fn kho v\'e0 ch\u7881\'3f th\u7883\'3f, s\u7889\'3f 298-CT ng\'e0y 4/10/1987 \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'f9 \'f0\u7855\'3fp, n\u7871\'3fu v\u7851\'3fn c}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'f2n thi\u7871\'3fu th\'ec b\'e1o c\'e1o v\u7899\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh,  Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd\u7899\'3fc  Vi\u7879\'3ft nam \'f0\u7875\'3f xem x\'e9t x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2648798\charrsid4733429 \'fd.
